# Apple's documentation, mirrored locally for grounding UI and API work
# (docs/reference/apple/README.md explains the shape and how to extend it).
# It is Apple's copyright, ~12MB of it, and this repo is meant to ship — so the
# mirror stays on disk and out of history, where a later removal would mean a
# rewrite rather than a delete. Regenerate it with docs/reference/apple/tools/.
docs/reference/

# Screen recordings staged for the landing page. 12MB of binaries that nothing
# in site/ references yet — the stills under site/assets/shots/ ARE tracked and
# are what the pages actually use. Git handles a re-encoded video by storing
# another whole copy, so a few passes at a demo reel outweighs the entire source
# tree. If one of these is ever embedded in a page, host it somewhere built for
# video rather than un-ignoring it here.
site/assets/videos/

# Build cache from wrangler, not source.
worker/.wrangler/

# The KYB demo video. 15 MB of binary would be permanent history in a repo of text.
Resources/airlock_demo.mp4
